Webhook fixes for Hermes Agent, applied at image build time.

1. Bare webhook routes (/webhooks/<route>, no /p/<profile>/ prefix) run
   inside the owning profile's runtime scope whenever the multiplex secret
   guard is active, instead of with no scope. Under profile multiplexing
   that is the default profile; otherwise the gateway's launch profile.
2. A route may set `script_timeout` (seconds) to override the adapter-wide
   script timeout for its filter script.

The Dockerfile applies every patches/*.patch with `git apply`. A patch that
upstream already contains is skipped; one that no longer fits is skipped with
a warning and the build continues.

